Package: scHINT
Title: Heritability of Gene Expression Across Cell States and Cell Types
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Lida", "Wang", email = "lida_wang@dfci.harvard.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Haseman-Elston regression estimators of genetic variance in
    single-cell and pseudobulk gene expression, including genotype-by-cell-state
    and genotype-by-cell-type interactions, multiple GRMs, additional covariates
    and jackknife standard errors.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0)
Imports: stats, utils
URL: https://LidaWangPSU.github.io/scHINT/, https://github.com/LidaWangPSU/scHINT
BugReports: https://github.com/LidaWangPSU/scHINT/issues
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Suggests: BEDMatrix, testthat (>= 3.0.0), knitr, rmarkdown
Config/testthat/edition: 3
LazyData: true
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
